<urn:atm:triage:finding/AW1-RBP-F002>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AW1-RBP-F002" ;
  triage:title "Invalid correlation_id silently dropped via CorrelationId::new(..).ok() with no diagnostic counter" ;
  triage:description "rust-best-practices-agent RBP-F002: crates/atm-observability/src/tracing_bridge.rs:268-269 maps an invalid correlation_id to None via CorrelationId::new(value.to_owned()).ok() with no counter or retained diagnostic, so malformed ids vanish without trace. Add a counter (e.g. dropped_invalid_correlation_id_total on TracingBridgeStats) or retain the raw value under a distinct allowlisted field." ;
